{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in", "label": "ADR 0010: Gate CI on a hermetic suite at 100% coverage, with live tests opt-in", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-gate-on-a-hermetic-suite-and-keep-live-tests-opt-in.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "adr_id": "0010", "status": "Accepted", "date": "2026-08-19"}, {"id": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in_hermetic_unit_suite", "label": "Hermetic unit suite as the merge gate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-gate-on-a-hermetic-suite-and-keep-live-tests-opt-in.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Most behaviour is a reaction to what a real transport produces, so client and describer tests run against an in-process http.server fixture rather than a mocked urlopen. Deterministic; needs no model, GPU or network."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in_coverage_gate_100", "label": "100% line and branch coverage gate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-gate-on-a-hermetic-suite-and-keep-live-tests-opt-in.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "pragma: no cover permitted only on the __main__ guard (and the integration-skip branch). In a library this size the uncovered lines are exactly its error branches. Every new branch, including CLI argparse type functions, arrives with a test. A lower target was not weighed."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in_opt_in_live_tests", "label": "Opt-in, non-blocking live tests", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-gate-on-a-hermetic-suite-and-keep-live-tests-opt-in.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "tests/integration/test_live.py runs only with DESCRIBE_IT_INTEGRATION=1 and a host answering /api/version; the env var is checked first so collection opens no socket, and the probe uses a proxy-free opener. Never gates a merge. Seven runs with llava:7b on 2026-08-20: word-budget assertion failed 2/7, French failed 7/7; both model behaviour, assertions left as specified."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in_structural_assertions_only", "label": "Structural assertions only on live output", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-gate-on-a-hermetic-suite-and-keep-live-tests-opt-in.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No keyword matching because small models are not reliable enough to gate on. Length, language function words, exception type. Weak by construction, so a model that ignores an option fails them, which is information about the model."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in_hypothesis_property_tests", "label": "Property tests with hypothesis for stated invariants", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-gate-on-a-hermetic-suite-and-keep-live-tests-opt-in.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three properties: prepared image fits its bound and keeps aspect ratio; clean_response is idempotent; normalise_host always produces a usable base URL. Other invariants are covered by enumerated cases."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_19_describe_it_design", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-gate-on-a-hermetic-suite-and-keep-live-tests-opt-in.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in", "target": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in_hermetic_unit_suite", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-gate-on-a-hermetic-suite-and-keep-live-tests-opt-in.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in", "target": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in_coverage_gate_100", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-gate-on-a-hermetic-suite-and-keep-live-tests-opt-in.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in", "target": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in_opt_in_live_tests", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-gate-on-a-hermetic-suite-and-keep-live-tests-opt-in.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in", "target": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in_structural_assertions_only", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-gate-on-a-hermetic-suite-and-keep-live-tests-opt-in.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in", "target": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_hermetic_suite_and_keep_live_tests_opt_in_hypothesis_property_tests", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0010-gate-on-a-hermetic-suite-and-keep-live-tests-opt-in.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0010_gate_on_a_herm